WEBVTT

00:32.662 --> 00:38.203
The spotlight's dead The cable's coiled

00:40.563 --> 00:45.885
The magic trick has been completely spoiled

00:47.145 --> 00:52.126
Just an echo bouncing off the concrete floor

00:56.455 --> 01:02.857
No one's knocking at the backstage door Empty

01:03.017 --> 01:04.437
arenas

